# c10/core/ScalarType 伪代码

## 文件概述
来源: c10/core/ScalarType.cpp, c10/core/ScalarType.h

本文件定义了 PyTorch 的标量类型系统，包括类型枚举、类型转换、类型提升规则等。

---

## 1. 类型系统定义

--------------------------------
ScalarType 枚举
来源: ScalarType.h:154-160
--------------------------------

【定义】
    enum ScalarType : int8_t {
        // 基础类型 (0-11)
        Byte, Char, Short, Int, Long,// 整数类型
        Half, Float, Double,// 浮点类型
        ComplexHalf, ComplexFloat, ComplexDouble, // 复数类型
        Bool,                                    // 布尔类型
        // 量化类型 (12-17)
        QInt8, QUInt8, QInt32, QUInt4x2, QUInt2x4,
        // 位打包类型 (18-22)
        Bits1x8, Bits2x4, Bits4x2, Bits8, Bits16,
        
        // Float8 类型 (23-26)
        Float8_e5m2, Float8_e4m3fn, Float8_e5m2fnuz, Float8_e4m3fnuz,
        
        // 扩展无符号整数 (27-29)
        UInt16, UInt32, UInt64,
        
        // 子字节无符号整数 (30-36)
        UInt1, UInt2, UInt3, UInt4, UInt5, UInt6, UInt7,
        
        // 子字节有符号整数 (37-43)
        Int1, Int2, Int3, Int4, Int5, Int6, Int7,
        
        // Float8 扩展 (44)
        Float8_e8m0fnu,
        
        Undefined,
        NumOptions
    }

【备注】
    - 枚举顺序影响序列化格式和类型提升查找表
    - UInt1-7 和 Int1-7 使用 dummy_uint1_7_t<N> 和 dummy_int1_7_t<N> 占位，实际功能在 Python 层实现

---

## 2. 类型映射

--------------------------------
类型到 C++ 类型映射
来源: ScalarType.h:169-193
--------------------------------

【模板】
    template<ScalarType N>
    struct ScalarTypeToCPPType {
        using type = /* 对应的 C++ 类型 */;
    }

【映射表】
    Byte        -> uint8_t
    Char        -> int8_t
    Short       -> int16_t
    Int         -> int
    Long        -> int64_t
    Half        -> at::Half
    Float       -> float
    Double      -> double
    ComplexHalf -> c10::complex<c10::Half>
    ComplexFloat -> c10::complex<float>
    ComplexDouble -> c10::complex<double>
    Bool        -> bool
    BFloat16    -> at::BFloat16
    QInt8       -> c10::qint8
    QUInt8      -> c10::quint8
    QInt32      -> c10::qint32
    QUInt4x2    -> c10::quint4x2
    QUInt2x4    -> c10::quint2x4
    Bits1x8     -> c10::bits1x8
    Bits2x4     -> c10::bits2x4
    Bits4x2     -> c10::bits4x2
    Bits8       -> c10::bits8
    Bits16      -> c10::bits16
    Float8_e5m2 -> c10::Float8_e5m2
    Float8_e4m3fn -> c10::Float8_e4m3fn
    Float8_e5m2fnuz -> c10::Float8_e5m2fnuz
    Float8_e4m3fnuz -> c10::Float8_e4m3fnuz
    Float8_e8m0fnu -> c10::Float8_e8m0fnu
    UInt16      -> uint16_t
    UInt32      -> uint32_t
    UInt64      -> uint64_t
    UInt1-7     -> c10::dummy_uint1_7_t<N>
    Int1-7      -> c10::dummy_int1_7_t<N>

--------------------------------
C++ 类型到 ScalarType 映射
来源: ScalarType.h:196-208
--------------------------------

【模板】
    template<typename T>
    struct CppTypeToScalarType : std::integral_constant<ScalarType, /* 对应的 ScalarType */> {}

【用途】
    反向映射，从 C++ 类型获取 ScalarType 枚举值

---

## 3. 类型查询函数

--------------------------------
类型属性查询
来源: ScalarType.h
--------------------------------

【函数】
    toString(t: ScalarType) -> const char*
        用途: 返回类型名称字符串 (如 "Float", "Int")

    elementSize(t: ScalarType) -> size_t
        用途: 返回类型的字节大小
        算法: sizeof(对应的 C++ 类型)

    isIntegralType(t: ScalarType, includeBool: bool = false) -> bool
        用途: 判断是否为整数类型
        算法: t in {Byte, Char, Int, Long, Short, UInt16, UInt32, UInt64} 
              or (includeBool and t == Bool)

    isFloat8Type(t: ScalarType) -> bool
        用途: 判断是否为 Float8 类型
        算法: t in {Float8_e5m2, Float8_e5m2fnuz, Float8_e4m3fn, Float8_e4m3fnuz, Float8_e8m0fnu}

    isReducedFloatingType(t: ScalarType) -> bool
        用途: 判断是否为低精度浮点类型
        算法: t in {Half, BFloat16} or isFloat8Type(t)

    isFloatingType(t: ScalarType) -> bool
        用途: 判断是否为浮点类型
        算法: t in {Double, Float} or isReducedFloatingType(t)

    isComplexType(t: ScalarType) -> bool
        用途: 判断是否为复数类型
        算法: t in {ComplexHalf, ComplexFloat, ComplexDouble}

    isQIntType(t: ScalarType) -> bool
        用途: 判断是否为量化整数类型
        算法: t in {QInt8, QUInt8, QInt32, QUInt4x2, QUInt2x4}

    isBitsType(t: ScalarType) -> bool
        用途: 判断是否为位打包类型
        算法: t in {Bits1x8, Bits2x4, Bits4x2, Bits8, Bits16}

    isBarebonesUnsignedType(t: ScalarType) -> bool
        用途: 判断是否为扩展无符号整数类型
        算法: t in {UInt1-7, UInt16, UInt32, UInt64}

    isSignedType(t: ScalarType) -> bool
        用途: 判断是否为有符号类型
        算法: 
            if t in {QInt*, Bits*}: raise error
            if t in {Int1-7}: return true
            if t in {UInt1-7}: return false
            else: return std::numeric_limits<对应C++类型>::is_signed

---

## 4. 类型转换函数

--------------------------------
类型转换工具
来源: ScalarType.h
--------------------------------

【函数】
    toQIntType(t: ScalarType) -> ScalarType
        用途: 转换为对应的量化类型
        算法:Byte -> QUInt8
            Char -> QInt8
            Int  -> QInt32
            其他 -> t

    toUnderlying(t: ScalarType) -> ScalarType
        用途: 获取量化类型的底层类型
        算法:
            QUInt8, QUInt4x2, QUInt2x4 -> Byte
            QInt8 -> Char
            QInt32 -> Int
            其他 -> t

    isUnderlying(type: ScalarType, qtype: ScalarType) -> bool
        用途: 判断 type 是否为 qtype 的底层类型
        算法: type == toUnderlying(qtype)

    toRealValueType(t: ScalarType) -> ScalarType
        用途: 获取复数类型的实部类型
        算法:
            ComplexHalf -> Half
            ComplexFloat -> Float
            ComplexDouble -> Double
            其他 -> t

    toComplexType(t: ScalarType) -> ScalarType
        用途: 转换为对应的复数类型
        算法:
            BFloat16 -> ComplexFloat  # BFloat16 范围等价于 Float
            Half -> ComplexHalf
            Float -> ComplexFloat
            Double -> ComplexDouble
            Complex* -> 自身
            其他 -> error

---

## 5. 类型提升

--------------------------------
promoteTypes
来源: ScalarType.cpp:43-129
--------------------------------

【签名】
    promoteTypes(a: ScalarType, b: ScalarType) -> ScalarType

【算法】
    # Step 1: 特殊情况处理
    if a == Undefined or b == Undefined:
        return Undefined
    
    if a == b:
        return a
    
    if isQIntType(a) or isQIntType(b):
        raise error  # 量化类型提升未定义
    
    if isBitsType(a) or isBitsType(b):
        return Undefined
    
    if isFloat8Type(a) or isFloat8Type(b):
        raise error  # Float8 类型不支持提升
    
    if isBarebonesUnsignedType(a) or isBarebonesUnsignedType(b):
        # 无符号整数提升规则不完整，只处理浮点提升
        if isFloatingType(a): return a
        if isFloatingType(b): return b
        raise error
    
    # Step 2: 查表提升
    # 将类型映射到索引
    index2dtype = [Byte, Char, Short, Int, Long, Half, Float, Double,
                   ComplexHalf, ComplexFloat, ComplexDouble, Bool, BFloat16]
    
    dtype2index = 反向映射表
    
    ix_a = dtype2index[a]
    ix_b = dtype2index[b]
    
    # 提升查找表 (13x13)
    # 行列分别对应 index2dtype 中的类型
    _promoteTypesLookup = [
        # u1  i1  i2  i4  i8  f2  f4  f8  c2  c4  c8  b1  bf
        [u1, i2, i2, i4, i8, f2, f4, f8, c2, c4, c8, u1, bf],  # u1
        [i2, i1, i2, i4, i8, f2, f4, f8, c2, c4, c8, i1, bf],  # i1
        [i2, i2, i2, i4, i8, f2, f4, f8, c2, c4, c8, i2, bf],  # i2
        [i4, i4, i4, i4, i8, f2, f4, f8, c2, c4, c8, i4, bf],  # i4
        [i8, i8, i8, i8, i8, f2, f4, f8, c2, c4, c8, i8, bf],  # i8
        [f2, f2, f2, f2, f2, f2, f4, f8, c2, c4, c8, f2, f4],  # f2
        [f4, f4, f4, f4, f4, f4, f4, f8, c4, c4, c8, f4, f4],  # f4
        [f8, f8, f8, f8, f8, f8, f8, f8, c8, c8, c8, f8, f8],  # f8
        [c2, c2, c2, c2, c2, c2, c4, c8, c2, c4, c8, c2, c4],  # c2
        [c4, c4, c4, c4, c4, c4, c4, c8, c4, c4, c8, c4, c4],  # c4
        [c8, c8, c8, c8, c8, c8, c8, c8, c8, c8, c8, c8, c8],  # c8
        [u1, i1, i2, i4, i8, f2, f4, f8, c2, c4, c8, b1, bf],  # b1
        [bf, bf, bf, bf, bf, f4, f4, f8, c4, c4, c8, bf, bf],  # bf
    ]
    
    return _promoteTypesLookup[ix_a][ix_b]

【备注】
    - 提升规则基于 NumPy 的 promote_types
    - 查找表顺序必须与 index2dtype 一致
    - 整数 + 浮点 -> 浮点
    - 实数 + 复数 -> 复数
    - Bool 作为独立类别，不与其他类型提升

---

## 6. 类型转换规则

--------------------------------
canCast
来源: ScalarType.h:566-591
--------------------------------

【签名】
    canCast(from: ScalarType, to: ScalarType) -> bool

【算法】
    # 禁止复数 -> 非复数
    if isComplexType(from) and not isComplexType(to):
        return false
    
    # 禁止浮点 -> 整数
    if isFloatingType(from) and isIntegralType(to, includeBool=false):
        return false
    
    # 禁止非 Bool -> Bool
    if from != Bool and to == Bool:
        return false
    
    return true

【备注】
    - 用于判断 in-place 操作是否允许类型转换
    - 例如: int_tensor *= float 被禁止

---

## 7. 类型名称映射

--------------------------------
getDtypeNames
来源: ScalarType.cpp:131-231
--------------------------------

【签名】
    getDtypeNames(scalarType: ScalarType) -> (name: string, legacy_name: string)

【算法】
    返回类型的标准名称和遗留名称（如果有）
    
    示例:
        Byte -> ("uint8", "")
        Char -> ("int8", "")
        Float -> ("float32", "float")
        Double -> ("float64", "double")
        Int -> ("int32", "int")
        Long -> ("int64", "long")
        Half -> ("float16", "half")
        Bool -> ("bool", "")
        BFloat16 -> ("bfloat16", "")
        ComplexFloat -> ("complex64", "cfloat")
        ComplexDouble -> ("complex128", "cdouble")
        QInt8 -> ("qint8", "")
        Float8_e5m2 -> ("float8_e5m2", "")
        UInt1 -> ("uint1", "bit")
        ...

--------------------------------
getStringToDtypeMap
来源: ScalarType.cpp:233-254
--------------------------------

【签名】
    getStringToDtypeMap() -> const unordered_map<string, ScalarType>&

【算法】
    # 懒初始化全局映射表
    static result: unordered_map<string, ScalarType>
    
    if result.empty():
        for scalar_type in all_scalar_types:
            (name, legacy_name) = getDtypeNames(scalar_type)
            result[name] = scalar_type
            if legacy_name != "":
                result[legacy_name] = scalar_type
    
    return result

【用途】
    从字符串名称解析 ScalarType，支持标准名称和遗留名称
